 included in the totals of the Series A and B warrants in the table above.</span></td><td style="width:2.15pt;"></td></tr></table></ix:continuation></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="border-bottom-style:solid;border-bottom-width:0.5pt;text-decoration-line:underline;text-decoration-style:double;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><a id="Tc_r1Q8AQGlbEW7qISf9AOvcA_1_2"></a><a id="Tc_TnP9cuZ_Jk6vqGOP8_IcJw_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_JW5GqijYIkOClxCs2LOMiw_2_5"></a><a id="Tc_oELTBiMYHUGBXLNwyYHf2Q_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_GiRkZ-O5zE2bdguXNumUXQ_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_6DGmn5liUkaeHHP1DvdPFA_4_2"></a><a id="Tc_f0Un9lBYLEmbMy7AN74Uew_4_5"></a><a id="Tc_v0OrzMJwV0mZCYqDail2VQ_5_0"></a><a id="Tc__ShNbKdJE0mUCQLPwmlrqA_6_0"></a><a id="Tc_v_guBf6Ov02ELgHpbSh6rQ_7_0"></a><a id="Tc_S8XTjEomQk2BtHQjMiAc3Q_7_6"></a><a id="Tc_BPLuVSlP_EyMrBcEUBpAFw_8_0"></a><a id="Tc_LIt0GErqqk629G3AA_ywUQ_8_6"></a><a id="Tc_hvy9vlybXkCCc151eePDaQ_10_0"></a><a id="Tc_Rq--2dDLS0Sp2q7ur97xkQ_11_0"></a><a id="Tc_odJ9mjEdYkWL42Piy7Rbww_13_0"></a><a id="Tc_VDpyZWdodEG4gC5-upabmg_13_2"></a><a id="Tc_xV0hTDgaTUiCZKJmOiTXcw_13_3"></a><a id="Tc__VmyObs3x06rKmCMJ8-tsA_13_5"></a><a id="Tc_nm5ReqCHSUGSQsfWpqYVXA_13_6"></a><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" name="us-gaap:IncomeTaxDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_VXHZijF5XE-H61-7ZTo2MQ" continuedAt="Tb_VXHZijF5XE-H61-7ZTo2MQ_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;14&#160;&#8211; INCOME TAXES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company&#8217;s deferred tax assets relate primarily to its net operating loss carryforwards and other balance sheet basis differences. The Company maintains a valuation allowance to fully offset the gross deferred tax asset because it is not more likely than not that the Company will realize future benefits associated with these deferred tax assets at December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020. The valuation allowance increased by approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ValuationAllowanceDeferredTaxAssetChangeInAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_uRq25uDucEqDq9wlx7nQBQ">2,178,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_n7TpjktE40-yYVtkxqhGJg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ValuationAllowanceDeferredTaxAssetChangeInAmount" scale="0" id="Narr_TGuF0tJ_S0SBA53HysnvxA">515,000</ix:nonFraction> for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020, respectively.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">Significant components of the Company&#8217;s deferred tax assets are as follows:</p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" name="us-gaap:ScheduleOfDeferredTaxAssetsAndLiabilitiesTableTextBlock" id="Tb_D3-NB8-7x0i-M7BdASh2nA" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:73.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><div style="height:1pt;overflow:hidden;overflow-wrap:break-word;position:relative;"><div style="bottom:0pt;position:absolute;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></di