in:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.12%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.13%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_f1EhT_zVtUu_YseciKC3uw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:DeferredTaxAssetsValuationAllowance" scale="0" id="Tc__B-NtryqJEieSwbrCwnWsw_11_6">1,866,000</ix:nonFraction>)</p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:73.53%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.96%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.12%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.13%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.98%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.12%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.13%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td></tr><tr><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:73.53%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">Deferred tax asset, net of valuation allowance</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.96%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.12%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.13%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> &#8212;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.98%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.12%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:10.13%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> &#8212;</p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">At December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020, the Company had U.S. federal and state income tax net operating loss (&#8220;NOL&#8221;) carryforward of approximately $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2021_r0zB2TDpJE2o8Ldkynx9Gw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="0" id="Narr_dn849_3Td0uW_z8YKbBWrw">6,482,000</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="As_Of_12_31_2020_f1EhT_zVtUu_YseciKC3uw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:OperatingLossCarryforwards" scale="0" id="Narr_SluwK4QoqkavhuXnosuIfg">1,180,000</ix:nonFraction>, respectively, that may be used to offset future taxable income. The Internal Revenue Code (the &#8220;IRC&#8221;) contains limitations on the use of net operating loss carryforwards after the occurrence of a substantial ownership change as defined by IRC Section&#160;382. The Company has not performed a detailed analysis, however utilization of such net operating loss carryforwards will likely be significantly limited due to the shares issued in the Primary Financing and the Merger. At December&#160;31, 2021, the Company had approximately <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_p5M2apQ4K065AgraPpBRFA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$102,000</span></span> of federal research and development (&#8220;R&amp;D&#8221;) tax credit carryforwards. If not utilized, the federal R&amp;D credits will begin to expire in 2038.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-42</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">QUOIN PHARMACEUTICALS LTD.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December 31, 2021, 2020 and 2019</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_VXHZijF5XE-H61-7ZTo2MQ_cont1"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The income tax benefit for the&#160;years ended December&#160;31, 2021 and 2020 differed from the amounts computed by applying the US federal income tax rate of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_C5G16pBtF0ugU8N3BZav8w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2020_To_12_31_2020_n7TpjktE40-yYVtkxqhGJg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_zMwI0fJqzU29p_3OZiPWkQ"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_C5G16pBtF0ugU8N3BZav8w" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:EffectiveIncomeTaxRateReconciliationAtFederalStatutoryIncomeTaxRate" scale="-2" id="Narr_P0akOmJTI0qqj-G-_H1sIg">21</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction>% primarily because of the increase in the valuation allowance and the tax impact of fair value adjustments and other permanent items, which resulted in an effective tax rate of zero for both&#160;years.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March&#160;27, 2020, the United States enacted the Coronavirus Aid, Relief and Economic Security Act (&#8220;CARES Act&#8221;). The CARES Act is an emergency economic stimulus package that includes spending and tax breaks to strengthen the United States economy and fund a nationwide effort to curtail the effect of COVID-19. While the CARES Act provides sweeping tax changes in response to the COVID-19 pandemic, some of the more significant provisions which are expected to impact the Company&#8217;s financial statements include removal of certain limitations on utilization of net operating losses, increasing the loss carryback period for certain losses to five&#160;years, and increasing the ability to deduct interest expense, as well as amending certain provisions of the previously enacted Tax Cuts and Jobs Act. The Company has concluded that the CARES Act did not have a material impact on its financial position, results of operations, or cash flows.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">On December&#160;27, 2020, the United States enacted the Consolidated Appropriations Act which extended many of the benefits of the CARES Act that were scheduled to expire. The Company evaluated the impact of the Consolidated Appropriations Act on its consolidated financial statements and related disclosures and concluded that the impact is immaterial.</p></ix:continuation><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDisclosures" id="Tb_L32r9oTATUKzARBxA4Rnuw" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;15&#160;- CONTINGENCIES</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">From time to time, the Company may become involved in various legal matters arising in the ordinary course of business. Management is unaware of any matters requiring accrual for related losses in the financial statements.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">In February&#160;2020, the seller of the equity interests in Polytherapeutics and party to the Research Agreement communicated with Quoin Inc. threatening litigation for non-payment and related breach of contract and immediate payment of all&#160;monthly payments in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_2_1_2020_To_2_29_2020_tu3RjWzzP06MUZHgP2QGOg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:LossContingencyDamagesSoughtValue" scale="0" id="Narr_gGUNdVrPTEKe7grNw9tj2A">666,667</ix:nonFraction>. See Notes&#160;9 and 12. The Consultant has not provided any services and has not complied with other technical requirements under the Research Agreement, and therefore is considered to be in breach of contract. The Company and the Consultant have had communications with respect to the duration, commencement date and payment of the consulting services, but a revised agreement has not been reached. No lawsuits have been filed as of the financial statement issuance date. Should a formal claim or lawsuit be filed, the Company believes it has meritorious defenses.</p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" name="qnrx:LicenseAgreementsTextBlock" id="Tb_svhXqoHxDEyTuBhO8TpGeg" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE&#160;16&#160;&#8211; LICENSE AGREEMENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">In November and December 2021, the Company entered into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Aw5bScmEv0qP_d_lDSMZrQ" contextRef="Duration_11_1_2021_To_11_30_2021_QT0GwGkgDkqf9BmWSilCIA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfLicenseAndSupplyAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_JW953Oy4WkSuzKlAoSUFSw"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Aw5bScmEv0qP_d_lDSMZrQ" contextRef="Duration_12_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_nTc--LTlv0a2TCcbghF_Nw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfLicenseAndSupplyAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_mi0LcbD3fkaXDsR6-wOtjg">three</ix:nonFraction></ix:nonFraction> license and supply agreements, whereby the Company is entitled to a royalty or other proceeds from the specified product revenues in select non-US markets from the licensee, if and when the underlying products are approved and commercialized. <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="us-gaap:RoyaltyIncomeNonoperating" scale="0" id="Narr_eJhkI-jKY0aygS6hb47nvA">No</ix:nonFraction> royalty revenues were received in 2021. </p></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 2.5pt 0pt 0pt;"><span style="margin-right:0pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_1_1_2021_To_12_31_2021_OJr2skXNqkqIByWrd_VGSQ" name="us-gaap:SubsequentEventsTextBlock" id="Tb_h6Njps4UkEuvQv17CqhT0A" continuedAt="Tb_h6Njps4UkEuvQv17CqhT0A_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 2.15pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">NOTE 17 - SUBSEQUENT EVENTS</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In March 2022, the Company paid an aggregate of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_p90xY946zkSVeeyE7AWduw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:RepaymentsOfNotesPayable" scale="0" id="Narr_YmZK15XJoUyrutG6xX9FSQ">311,670</ix:nonFraction> to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Aw5bScmEv0qP_d_lDSMZrQ" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_p90xY946zkSVeeyE7AWduw" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfNotePayablesSettled" scale="0" id="Narr_ItPqyBZ9VU2X5J6Qt_cyWg">two</ix:nonFraction> out of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Aw5bScmEv0qP_d_lDSMZrQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2022_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_GghMG8Ofj0eL105dfs7ewA" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfNotePayables" scale="0" id="Narr_aiZ6c7DAhkqf5tvDdNOxnQ">five</ix:nonFraction> 2020 noteholders in settlement of the amounts included in accrued interest payable at the closing of the Merger. See Note&#160;4.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In the first quarter of 2022, the Company entered into <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_item_Aw5bScmEv0qP_d_lDSMZrQ" contextRef="Duration_1_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_G8Ahp31NNUGS0pzAylpvEQ" decimals="0" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfLicenseAndSupplyAgreementsEntered" scale="0" id="Narr_ir8xipf1TUqLgYPVlCS89A">four</ix:nonFraction> license and supply agreements, whereby the Company will receive a royalty or other proceeds from the specified product revenues in select non-US markets from the licensor, if and when the underlying products are approved and commercialized.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Effective as of March 13, 2022, the Company issued warrants to purchase ADSs as follows:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Exchanged the existing warrants of 2020 noteholders (Note 4) for warrants on substantially the same terms as the Investor Exchange Warrant (See Note 5), exercisable for </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsMember_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_0aavHLWZh0KdM8MKOtbsHQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_Kq3Aj3nq-0qm-8leskYfKA">29,388</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs, in the aggregate, at the exercise price of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsMember_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_0aavHLWZh0KdM8MKOtbsHQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_2vXyjNDWZkWpfMdpEERTQA">49.75</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per ADS. The exercise price was reduced to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsMember_us-gaap_ShortTermDebtTypeAxis_qnrx_Convertiblenotes2020Member_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_4uO2oKXU6EioGB8h695p7Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_qEBA0VQBE0itF_v5VOMLZA">0.00</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> as of July 14, 2022 as a result of the Altium Agreement described below. </span></td><td style="width:2.15pt;"></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Issued Series A Warrant, </span><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_RV9JT4ULyE2CEROSYOTb7g;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Series B</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> Warrant and </span><span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_beJZIaFcLEe2vaY9FNtw1A;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Series C</span></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> Warrant to purchase </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_yocwTJMtvkCYWYJmLa_nZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_4EfMfk-Mu0WLQUljVDpElw">342,100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs, </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesBMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_VHsj68B3v0CCp0sW-z-1-g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_HyGQTuuDm0OMeIK8BUg4Ag">342,100</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs and </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesCMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_I0cyYB40ikK_0I1c24lkUA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_KXsqJxwLhk64Gn_zlfkPJA">191,174</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> </span></td><td style="width:2.15pt;"></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-43</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">QUOIN PHARMACEUTICALS LTD.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December 31, 2021, 2020 and 2019</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_h6Njps4UkEuvQv17CqhT0A_cont1" continuedAt="Tb_h6Njps4UkEuvQv17CqhT0A_cont2"><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;"></td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">ADSs, respectively, at the exercise price of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="As_Of_3_13_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_yocwTJMtvkCYWYJmLa_nZA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_Z2b7-7U56kac8inuF0QlHw">49.75</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> per ADS, based on the terms of the Primary Financing. These warrants were amended as of July 14, 2022 under the Altium Agreement described below.</span></td><td style="width:2.15pt;"></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The Company held a Special General Meeting on February 28, 2022, at which the Company&#8217;s shareholders adopted the Amended and Restated Articles of Association of the Company.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 2.15pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Amended and Restated Equity Incentive Plan and Annual Meeting of Shareholders</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">In March 2022, our board of directors approved the Amended and Restated Equity Incentive Plan (the &#8220;Amended Plan&#8221;), which increased the number of ordinary shares reserved for issuance under such equity incentive plan to <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_C5G16pBtF0ugU8N3BZav8w" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_49udPmljaU-20n0CSvCk-g" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuancePercentage" scale="-2" id="Narr_ZiGmFJvu7UukxIklKf7Uvg">15</ix:nonFraction>% of our outstanding ordinary shares on a fully-diluted basis, or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_fwhjHf_A-Eyw8Vjcq8TPjg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockCapitalSharesReservedForFutureIssuance" scale="0" id="Narr_FOQn0xkHuUWeO5qZSTzzyQ">1,826,991,616</ix:nonFraction> ordinary shares, represented by <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_fwhjHf_A-Eyw8Vjcq8TPjg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:NumberOfAmericanDepositorySharesRepresentedByOrdinaryStock" scale="0" id="Narr_c7I2SeXWJEqqolaJLpezpg">365,398</ix:nonFraction> ADSs as of March 31, 2022. The board of directors further approved the award of options to our officers and directors to purchase, in the aggregate, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_49udPmljaU-20n0CSvCk-g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardSharesPurchasedForAward" scale="0" id="Narr_WHtj4qsKdkOFidPTKbJDOw">316,571</ix:nonFraction> ADSs under the Amended Plan, and annual discretionary bonuses for officers of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_3_1_2022_To_3_31_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_0vlCF9MZVU2VXe_eBD8CUg" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:AnnualDiscretionaryBonuses" scale="0" id="Narr_mjzOpNoBSE6YMOXTbGIbmA">472,500</ix:nonFraction> in aggregate. </p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">We held our Annual General Meeting on April 12, 2022, at which our shareholders approved, among other items, the following:</p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The increase in authorized share capital from </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_4_11_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_YLBfBQv-4UWi_xz6S8HB-w" decimals="-8" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="9" id="Narr_QWow3PdzMkCxv6zbf7rscw">12.5</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> billion to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_eeTTXVrubUaFUxN01DEtuQ" decimals="-9" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:CommonStockSharesAuthorized" scale="9" id="Narr_KTyfHOxisU2r3bsNy4ZKRw">50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> billion ordinary shares. </span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Modification of the annual compensation of the two founders to a combined base salary of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_d9gJRApsp062jxveogfvfw" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:CombinedBaseSalaryOfTwoFounders" scale="0" id="Narr_941h_lHqEEW940AoToYblQ">990,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> and to increase the annual discretionary bonus to not less than </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_C5G16pBtF0ugU8N3BZav8w" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_srt_RangeAxis_srt_MinimumMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_kli5S-KW1UmJ_toRa6ZjOg" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:PercentageOfAnnualDiscretionaryBonusOnAnnualBaseSalary" scale="-2" id="Narr_WRSeJvohXU2hU_VFyN-hyw">45</ix:nonFraction>%</span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> of the annual base salary.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Repayment of amounts due to the two founders at a rate of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_PRkgl4PSWEeJlMDgLsg-WQ" contextRef="As_Of_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_eeTTXVrubUaFUxN01DEtuQ" decimals="0" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:RepaymentOfAmountsPerEachMonthToTwoFounders" scale="0" id="Narr_nXb1OfRbY0Or7g6z7xNr4w">25,000</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> each per month.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.13;margin-bottom:12pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The grant of an option to purchase up to </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_qnrx_TwoFoundersMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_wMyVmGGJcEe7rycTZrwD3w" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesExercisableForOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_q5Z27hwpAEOtcCn-QoChmQ">85,714</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs to each of the two founders under the Amended Plan, at an exercise price per ADS of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_qnrx_TwoFoundersMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_weZiJAErqUWSmkF33QJFCA" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_XvF2Qp3WakGlup6bR7lzOA">17.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, to vest over a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_qnrx_TwoFoundersMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_weZiJAErqUWSmkF33QJFCA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_r0oIAxih9UiSlL6oag7-2g"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">four-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> period.</span></td></tr></table><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.13;margin-bottom:0pt;margin-top:0pt;table-layout:fixed;width:100%;border:0pt;"><tr><td style="width:18pt;"></td><td style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;vertical-align:text-top;white-space:nowrap;width:18pt;padding:0pt;">&#9679;</td><td style="padding:0pt;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">The grant of an option to purchase </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_DirectorMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_B7YxN06nKkyQnlnH5141kw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesExercisableForOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_i6m1GZ9dNUiNplATLELqeQ">12,857</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs to each of the </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_WfGIW60sX02nyi791vxHxg" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_d9gJRApsp062jxveogfvfw" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="qnrx:NumberOfNonEmployeeDirectors" scale="0" id="Narr_eIGOxiDOAUusWVmaNrMoAw">five</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> non-employee director under the Amended Plan at an exercise price per ADS of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_DirectorMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_b87jo0RswE2wyhhZWI-yDw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_25RKf4n7zkqw54APBxCygg">17.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, to vest over a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_srt_TitleOfIndividualAxis_srt_DirectorMember_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_qnrx_AmendedAndRestatedEquityIncentivePlanMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_b87jo0RswE2wyhhZWI-yDw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_d-rFgfpFL0yjXkCNQIxU0g"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">three-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> period, and (as an annual grant for 2022) an option to an officer to purchase </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"><ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_eeTTXVrubUaFUxN01DEtuQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfSharesExercisableForOptions" scale="0" id="Narr_pk3W6u_P9EiimTyaI6d1tQ">71,429</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> ADSs at an exercise price per ADS of </span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">$<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_d9gJRApsp062jxveogfvfw" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementsByShareBasedPaymentAwardOptionsGrantsInPeriodWeightedAverageExercisePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_p7uh6mPFnUW3q3FC3SccIA">17.50</ix:nonFraction></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">, to vest over a </span><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_12_2022_To_4_12_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_d9gJRApsp062jxveogfvfw" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_7qxWpUjDoE-VwVDgwNicWQ"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">four-year</span></ix:nonNumeric><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;"> period.</span></td></tr></table><div style="margin-top:12pt;"></div><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.13;margin:0pt 2.15pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">ADS Ratio Change</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 12, 2022, our Board of Directors approved the change in the ratio of ADS evidencing ordinary shares from 1 ADS representing four hundred (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="Duration_7_11_2022_To_7_11_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_3Y-Va2Fgc0-Z1BcdIsFqwQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:NumberOfSharesRepresentingForOneAmericanDepositaryShare" scale="0" id="Narr_dHT88WrTE0ekJ3xx5F8awQ">400</ix:nonFraction>) ordinary shares to 1 ADS representing five thousand (<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="Duration_7_12_2022_To_7_12_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_ek6UQ0-r6kOretwTPmXHpA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="qnrx:NumberOfSharesRepresentingForOneAmericanDepositaryShare" scale="0" id="Narr_FYubieQMDkOlON3DqqbtNw">5,000</ix:nonFraction>) ordinary shares, which will result in a one for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_C5G16pBtF0ugU8N3BZav8w" contextRef="Duration_7_12_2022_To_7_12_2022_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_ek6UQ0-r6kOretwTPmXHpA" decimals="1" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockholdersEquityNoteStockSplitConversionRatio1" scale="0" id="Narr_xjG7d87aTk2bLRAKt0fpWw">12.5</ix:nonFraction> reverse split of the issued and outstanding ADSs (the &#8220;Ratio Change&#8221;). The Ratio Change was effective August 1, 2022. All ADS and related option and warrant information presented in these financial statements and accompanying footnotes has been retroactively adjusted to reflect the reduced number of ADSs resulting from the Ratio Change.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Nasdaq Listing</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On April 22, 2022, we received a letter from the Listing Qualifications staff of The Nasdaq Stock Market, LLC (&#8220;Nasdaq&#8221;) notifying us that we are no longer in compliance with the minimum stockholders&#8217; equity requirement for continued listing on The Nasdaq Capital Market. Nasdaq Rule 5550(b)(1) requires listed companies to maintain stockholders&#8217; equity of at least $2.5 million. In addition, as of April 21, 2022, we did not meet the alternative continued listing requirements based on market value of listed securities or net income from continuing operations. In accordance with Nasdaq Rule 5810(c)(2)(A), within 45 calendar days of receiving this notice, we submitted a plan to regain compliance to Nasdaq. This plan was accepted, and Nasdaq has granted us an extension until October 19, 2022 to evidence compliance.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">On June 10, 2022, we received a letter from The Nasdaq Listing Qualifications staff notifying us that the closing bid price per ADS was below the required minimum of $1.00 for a period of 30 consecutive business days and that we did not meet the minimum bid price requirements set forth in Nasdaq Rule 5550(a)(2). Pursuant to Nasdaq Rule 5810(c)(3)(A), we have a period of one hundred eighty (180) calendar days, or until December 7, 2022 (the &#8220;Compliance Period&#8221;), to regain compliance with Nasdaq&#8217;s minimum bid </p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">F-44</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;min-height:14.4pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">QUOIN PHARMACEUTICALS LTD.</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">Notes to Consolidated Financial Statements</b></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><b style="font-weight:bold;">December 31, 2021, 2020 and 2019</b></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><a id="Tc_w6ClZ-kwS06X0Xa6l3iMqA_1_4"></a><a id="Tc_JziVKxbq7kaMU7du8m0_fQ_1_7"></a><a id="Tc_jlV69wG1Mki8gJzS_5AjbQ_2_2"></a><a id="Tc_kwe_MRvYi0ecBZokyFfC7A_2_4"></a><a id="Tc_BgiJMCoU1U6sl9HKmyuiwQ_2_7"></a><a id="Tc_3Zi-AjaA4UKjOF7HxHagTw_3_0"></a><a id="Tc_nyIENdLPkEWEYt8ONTFlqA_3_4"></a><a id="Tc_H30EbW833UqHJb1d2IA6rg_3_7"></a><a id="Tc_rr4g7b37xUmyU9b5b9Htwg_4_0"></a><a id="Tc_QWKSf5EaoUCN-fZwZ4ijUA_4_4"></a><a id="Tc_HUOuZyLhWEOr-4YjBisbwA_4_7"></a><a id="Tc_eIyB4s0qNEaDZQGJ3QobIA_5_0"></a><ix:continuation id="Tb_h6Njps4UkEuvQv17CqhT0A_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">price requirement. If at any time during the Compliance Period, the closing bid price per ADS is at least $1.00 for a minimum of ten (10) consecutive business days, Nasdaq will provide us a written confirmation of compliance and the matter will be closed. In the event we do not regain compliance by December 7, 2022, we may be eligible for an additional 180 calendar day grace period. To qualify, we will be required to meet the continued listing requirement for market value of publicly held ADSs and all other initial listing standards for The Nasdaq Capital Market, with the exception of the bid price requirement, and will need to provide written notice of our intention to cure the deficiency during the second compliance period.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">Although there is no assurance, we expect that the offering that is being registered on the registration statement on Form F-1, which includes these financial statements and accompanying notes, will enable us to regain compliance with Nasdaq&#8217;s minimum stockholders&#8217; equity requirement and the Ratio Change will help us to regain compliance with the minimum bid-price requirement for continued listing on The Nasdaq Capital Market. Although Nasdaq notification letters described above have no immediate effect on our listing on The Nasdaq Capital Market, and we are working on implementing plans to regain compliance with Nasdaq listing standards, there can be no assurance that we will be able to regain compliance with Nasdaq&#8217;s minimum stockholders&#8217; equity requirement or minimum bid-price requirement for continued listing. If our ADSs are delisted from Nasdaq, it will have material negative impacts on the actual and potential liquidity of our securities, as well as material negative impacts on our ability to raise future capital.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;line-height:1.13;margin:0pt 2.15pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Agreements with Altium Growth Fund, LP and Altium Warrant Exercises</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">During the second quarter of 2022, Altium exercised the Series B Warrant in full pursuant to the alternate cashless exercise right of such warrant, under which Altium had an option to receive <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_6_30_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesBMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_Iyf86CLq7U2kBeU0tnwZOQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" scale="0" id="Narr_AeJrtnEV3EuGP10pR_3qpg">1</ix:nonFraction> ADS for each ADS underlying the warrant being exercised in such cashless exercise, resulting in the issuance of a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2022_To_6_30_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_WarrantSeriesBMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_S6FxrLsiXEa1lkB7N9mTag" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:StockIssuedDuringPeriodSharesNewIssues" scale="0" id="Narr_RTHnw1QUNkmj0ZAZRtOHEg">342,100</ix:nonFraction> ADSs to Altium.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On July 14, 2022, we, Quoin Inc. and Altium entered into an agreement (the &#8220;Altium Agreement&#8221;), pursuant to which the parties agreed to, among other things, (i) amend certain terms of the Series A Warrant and Investor Exchange Warrants previously issued to Altium to, among other things, reduce the exercise price to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsAndSeriesaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_qnrx_AltiumAgreementMember_wcw3fGa8l0CiR65SPn192g" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_Dw_3Diahh0eeVqIvavnjTw">0.00</ix:nonFraction> per ADS with respect to a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_7_14_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsAndSeriesaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_qnrx_AltiumAgreementMember_wcw3fGa8l0CiR65SPn192g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByWarrantsOrRights" scale="0" id="Narr_XyLAN5ovHU67NhJwxRelbQ">399,999</ix:nonFraction> ADSs, (ii) cancel the Series C Warrant and a portion of the Series A Warrant previously issued to Altium, and (iii) terminate the Purchase Agreements, pursuant to which the warrants were previously issued to Altium. As of August 2, 2022, Altium exercised all of its warrants outstanding and we issued a total of <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_8_2_2022_us-gaap_ClassOfWarrantOrRightAxis_qnrx_InvestorExchangeWarrantsAndSeriesaWarrantsMember_us-gaap_StatementClassOfStockAxis_dei_AdrMember_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_qnrx_AltiumAgreementMember_vDGgUtEqu0a5oKOzIsalvQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" scale="0" id="Narr_ACKTjaGBl0mARFcC3eifcg">399,999</ix:nonFraction> ADSs to Altium.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The exercise price of the 2020 noteholder warrants was reduced to $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_GM7M0fpeUEeWbxQzVezuXQ" contextRef="As_Of_7_14_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_qnrx_AltiumAgreementMember_6qEJOo2rR0C3eC9zSAQT5Q" decimals="2" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightExercisePriceOfWarrantsOrRights1" scale="0" id="Narr_SENxZ9MFoESlI5MBhZbXfQ">0.00</ix:nonFraction> as of July 14, 2022 as a result of the Altium Agreement described below. As of August 2, 2022, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Qbnw6BUOh0qJRl-bb0S5Xg" contextRef="As_Of_8_2_2022_us-gaap_SubsequentEventTypeAxis_us-gaap_SubsequentEventMember_us-gaap_TypeOfArrangementAxis_qnrx_AltiumAgreementMember_vsVLCYY920-z3jovO2FtZA" decimals="INF" format="ixt:numdotdecimal" name="us-gaap:ClassOfWarrantOrRightNumberOfSecuritiesCalledByEachWarrantOrRight" scale="0" id="Narr_fQc54qrNmUqX_nr-ZjVtEw">23,040</ix:nonFraction> noteholder warrants had been exercised.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-indent:18pt;margin:0pt;">As a result of the Altium and noteholder warrant exercises and the Altium Agreement, the warrants outstanding as of August 2, 2022 are set out below, exercisable into ADS:</p><ix:continuation id="Group_Mk0O0jBk5k6k62Cr0N4jIA_3"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><table style="border-collapse:collapse;font-size:16pt;height:max-content;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;width:100%;"><tr style="height:1pt;"><td style="vertical-align:bottom;width:60.06%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.89%;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt;"><span style="font-size:1pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="